---
const weekOne = [
  {
    lead: 'Build reproducibility.',
    body: "Can the system be built and run from a clean checkout by someone who didn't write it? The answer predicts the cost of every change that follows.",
  },
  {
    lead: 'A golden-case harness.',
    body: 'A set of known-good inputs and expected outputs, captured before anything is touched, so later claims about risk are testable rather than asserted.',
  },
  {
    lead: 'Inventory.',
    body: "What exists, what's running, what's reachable, and what nobody has opened in years.",
  },
];
---

<section class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
  <h2 class="font-mono text-lg mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2 text-white">How it runs</h2>

  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">Week one establishes ground truth.</p>

  <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
    {weekOne.map((item) => (
      <li class="border border-brand-slate p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="text-white">{item.lead}</span> {item.body}
        </p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <p class="mt-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
    Nothing in the assessment is worth reading if these three aren't settled first.
  </p>

  {/* Weeks two through four are authored from Maurice's own template. Do not draft them. */}
  <div class="mt-8 border-2 border-dashed border-amber-400 bg-amber-400/5 p-6">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400">
      TODO — page is unfinished
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-amber-200 leading-relaxed">
      Weeks two through four: copy pending. To be filled in from template — not to be drafted here.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-400/70">
      Remove this block before /consulting is linked publicly.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
